#: data/io.github.b1ngggg.netease_cloud_music_linux.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid ""
"NetEase Cloud Music Linux is a Linux desktop client based on NetEase Cloud "
"Music Gtk, with a redesigned UI, comments, and performance optimizations."
